@startuml sequence-konsultasi-whatsapp
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #dae8fc
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #6c8ebf

actor Customer
participant "Browser" as B
participant "Next.js Page" as P
participant "API Route\n/api/dealer" as A
participant "Prisma ORM" as PR
database "MySQL DB" as DB
participant "WhatsApp" as WA

Customer -> B: Klik tombol "Konsultasi via WhatsApp"
B -> P: Trigger onClick
P -> A: fetch(/api/dealer)
A -> PR: dealer.findFirst()
PR -> DB: SELECT whatsapp FROM Dealer
DB --> PR: nomor WhatsApp
PR --> A: Dealer data
A --> P: JSON response
P -> B: Generate wa.me link\ndengan nomor dealer
B -> WA: Redirect ke wa.me/[nomor]
WA --> Customer: Membuka chat WhatsApp

@enduml